    "gp_section_560744087947510869": {
      "type": "gp-section-560744087947510869",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "32983225056edced5b003619877275b204001e776a999e1a10d6954916024614_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gKegGvhiFSodc_text": "<p>Melt Apron Belly Fat With Just 2 Capsules A Day <span style=\"color:#F582AE;\">Finally Reclaim The Waist You Thought Was Gone Forever!</span></p>",
        "gaGcIecDtdtzx_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#772B90;\"><strong>MenoMate</strong></span> packs l0 science-backed plant extracts, adaptogens, and probiotics into a perfect daily dose designed to tackle stubborn midsection fat, lessen hot flashes, and rev up your energy.</p>",
        "gjYQIUQRrXNeh_text": "<p>By naturally recalibrating the hormones that derail your metabolism, MenoMate helps you shed pounds without drastic diets.</p>",
        "gcZBWMTBnWvSt_text": "<p>Each ingredient is backed by thousands of studies, ensuring you get fast, noticeable relief from the toughest menopausal symptoms so you can reclaim your waistline and your confidence.</p>",
        "gYKhuBtxFbGgc_text": "<p><u>Without</u> the need for intense diets or exercise...</p>",
        "gjJnWNpZOTySq_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#772B90;\">MenoMate's</span> 10 Superstar Ingredients:</p>",
        "giLsGRqoBcBkS_text": "Target Hormonal Belly Fat, Zap Hot Flashes & Reclaim Your Energy-Naturally",
        "ggNLam94m3P_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/banner.jpg?v=1744239557",
        "ggNLam94m3P_srcSet_tablet_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/banner.jpg?v=1744239557",
        "gCFBFEsOFOcDD_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "gPdLZGzkJDaih_text": "<p>Turmeric Root Extract (350mg)- \"Nature's Fire Extinguisher\"</p>",
        "gcUJtTYRUzCTz_text": "<p>Helps soothe joint discomfort, diminish stubborn bloating, and support a naturally faster metabolism so you can move freely without nagging aches.</p>",
        "gEIRvvjjTgfNT_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "guWDNgLGfqtcY_text": "<p>Inulin (337.5 mg)-\"The Belly-Flattening Prebiotic\"</p>",
        "gWvjqFycZeolt_text": "<p>Feeds beneficial gut bacteria to slash bloat, curb sugar cravings and speed healthy weight loss.</p>",
        "gAmOvQRqiCwIE_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "gVoJlYyNRyEBd_text": "<p>MenoMate Probiotic Blend (10 Billion CFUs) - \"Your Hormonal Weight Manager\" 3 in1 Probiotic Strains</p>",
        "gutRBpVZekmCl_text": "<p>Bifidobacterium animalis subsp.Lactis, Bifidobacterium breve, Lactobacillus gasseri clinically studied strains shown to clear out bloating, boost immunity, and smooth hormone swings. Feel lighter, more balanced, and less prone to \"hanger\" attacks.</p>",
        "gdkheNCrsCEnB_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggtI_NdZpyi_text": "<p>Curry Leaf Extract (50 mg)- \"The Metabolic Spark\"</p>",
        "gWNEgrXwISGvZ_text": "<p>Loaded with antioxidants to ignite your metabolism and maintain healthy blood sugar.</p>",
        "gIIaFYwrufEkr_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggIvBqtc12B_text": "<p>Black Cohosh (40 mg) - \"Hot Flash Eraser\"</p>",
        "gTCCTwLpNwaAO_text": "<p>Trusted for decades to tame menopausal hot flashes and night sweats.</p>",
        "gnXKTeiPpIhsY_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "gAoTpzpymQwKL_text": "Moringa Leaf Extract (35 mg) - \"Energy & Immunity Powerhouse\"",
        "gvzJTnMfwjLBR_text": "<p>Bursting with vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants to fight fatigue and support healthy immune function.</p>",
        "gXRihLaNzKXIo_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "grRcSNqJElipu_text": "<p>DIM (Di-Indolylmethane)(40 mg)-\"The Estrogen Reset\"</p>",
        "gSQnIcHkcuegV_text": "Naturally regulates bad estrogen levels, supports detox, and calms PMS or menopausal mood swings.",
        "ggCdCS75t3j_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggyyeQRIGm__text": "<p>BioperineOrganic Black Pepper Extract (3 mg)- \"The Absorption Amplifier\"&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggLWp1eFv0i_text": "<p>Ensures every precious drop of MenoMate's formula hits its target for maximum effect.</p>",
        "ggTno9YwrbB_label": "<p>Try MenoMate Now!</p>",
        "ggVRcwfpJhe_text": "<p>90-Day Money-back Guarantee</p>"
      }
    },
