        "gUAgLNqbwstvV_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#772B90;\"><strong>MenoMate</strong></span> helps you tackle the root hormonal imbalances so.</p>",
        "gg3l4MrHfVH_childItem_0": "<p><strong>Love Your Silhouette Again</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Slip effortlessly into your favorite clothes—goodbye “apron belly” and baggy sweatpants.</p>",
        "gg3l4MrHfVH_childItem_1": "<p><strong>Slash Hot Flashes By Up To 87%</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Go from 2–3 sweats a day to as little as 1–2 a week and finally sleep through the night.</p>",
        "gg3l4MrHfVH_childItem_2": "<p><strong>Turbocharge Your Mood</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Bypass irritability and random mood swings—rediscover calm, confidence, and emotional balance.</p>",
        "gg3l4MrHfVH_childItem_3": "<p><strong>Eat Without The “6-Month Pregnant” Bloat</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Enjoy your favorite meals minus the hard tummy or emergency bathroom visits.</p>",
        "gg3l4MrHfVH_childItem_4": "<p><strong>Wake Up Energized, Stay Strong All Day</strong> Ditch the midday crash—embrace clear-headed mornings and steady energy until bedtime.</p>",
        "gg3l4MrHfVH_childItem_5": "<p><strong>Walk, Bend &amp; Stretch Comfortably</strong> Support healthy, pain-free joints so you can keep moving, exercising, and living life to the fullest.</p>",
        "gmHnbQgXTCXiW_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#F582AE;\"><strong>Start Feeling Like Yourself Again Whether You're In Perimenopause, Menopause, Or Post-Menopause.</strong></span> With MenoMate, you can reclaim your figure, serenity, and spark-naturally.</p>",
        "ggsgTqnuf-M_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-521aa76a-8a33-4210-8e27-be99ece9f52c.png"
      }
