    "gp_section_560744087948362837": {
      "type": "gp-section-560744087948362837",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "78b06651a63a1fe2e9cab13ba5a9a2d9c673ca9d7468da11b03b451fdef0725f_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gi2l1a3a3e4d64_background_desktop_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-3a6c509e-a534-45ca-a491-aed3d3ea1bda.png",
        "gi2l1a3a3e4d64_background_tablet_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-3a6c509e-a534-45ca-a491-aed3d3ea1bda.png",
        "gi2l1a3a3e4d64_background_mobile_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-9581e136-ad75-4e9d-a5fd-9dd3c24ec4cd.png",
        "gszYGqLzOBmUe_text": "<p>Over <span style=\"color:#9128B4;\">682,700+</span> Women Are Experiencing Hormone Relief with MenoMate</p>",
        "gOYLtzXPaWRMh_text": "<p>Discover how women across the globe are losing stubborn weight, reducing hot flashes, and finally feeling at peace in their own bodies <strong>without</strong> crash diets or punishing exercise</p>",
        "gkzvDKVxbbZMn_text": "<p>I've never slept this well in years. After a few days on MenoMate, I noticed 1 was calmer, more focused, and far less bloated. My energy levels are through the roof. I highly recommend MenoMate to any woman in menopause-it's life changing!</p>",
        "gvNWNthLsiGRD_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "gzoNOfWvxkEJP_text": "Donna s.",
        "ggpTXsDpIcJ_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-fcd58a58-2a44-4db3-b17b-ae085edee9d0.png",
        "gdibeONFxMzze_text": "Verified buyer",
        "giPpISqNpXyua_text": "<p>Hot flashes used to wake me up three times a night-I was exhausted. Within two weeks of taking MenoMate, my hot flashes were down to maybe once or twice a week! My belly also looks flatter, and I'm back into my favorite jeans.</p>",
        "ggG22Dad8X2_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggOCh3t-eUS_text": "<p>Maria T.</p>",
        "ggVz7hxKNzx_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-fcd58a58-2a44-4db3-b17b-ae085edee9d0.png",
        "gg2LGafJcso_text": "Verified buyer",
        "gTSVppQVRPihz_text": "<p>I was skeptical at first because nothing worked for my'menopause belly' But MenoMate's the real deal. My stomach is noticeably flatter, I feel lighter, and I'm actually excited to. Iook in the mirror again.</p>",
        "ggOwxMKFGOn_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "ggQD1otzcjp_text": "<p>Kimberly L.</p>",
        "ggFAycpWMJi_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0810/1563/6283/files/gempages_501444340413891578-fcd58a58-2a44-4db3-b17b-ae085edee9d0.png",
        "ggBfSRtuE_b_text": "Verified buyer",
        "ggr_5oZrrOQ_label": "<p>Try MenoMate Now!</p>",
        "gwpdmMKsubLaI_text": "<p>90-Day Money-back Guarantee</p>",
        "gpubOZkHVclLg_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#A11CAD;\">The #1 frustration for women:</span> Sudden Weight Gain After 40</p>",
        "gfiDlVIjRNdxJ_text": "<p>Why do diets and exercise suddenly fail?</p>",
        "gjutyetiERQwe_text": "<p>Because once menopause hits, your body flips into<strong> \"fat storage mode\" </strong>- especially around your belly. This shift can begin as early as 30, blindsiding women whose been slim their entire lives.</p>",
        "gQzmPPxstfQnQ_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://ucarecdn.com/ee6d5074-1640-4cc7-8933-47c8589c3dee/-/format/auto/",
        "gGWMuYzewycKR_text": "Worse, no amount of extra cardio or crash dieting can fix it.",
        "gBRefzwPsvJwl_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#503ACC;\"><strong>Why?</strong></span> Because <strong>hormonal fat</strong> is different from normal fat.</p>",
        "gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_0": "<p><strong>Drops in estradiol</strong> slow your metabolism.&nbsp;</p>",
        "gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_1": "<p><strong>Spikes in cortisol</strong> lock stubborn weight around your waist.&nbsp;</p>",
        "gg3FV3wfeey_childItem_2": "<p><strong>Sluggish thyroid</strong> <strong>function</strong> leaves you too fatigued to keep fighting.</p>",
        "gg6oVysJJxT_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#F582AE;\"><strong>Result?</strong></span> The pounds won’t budge—no matter how hard you try.</p>",
        "ggHpOe1M_b5_text": "<p>That’s why <span style=\"color:#F582AE;\"><strong>traditional weight-loss methods </strong></span>simply don’t work for women over 40 dealing with hormonal imbalances. If you’re stuck, it’s not your fault—it’s your hormones. And the good news?</p>",
        "ggeZYm5NljU_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#F582AE;\"><strong>There is a way to address the real root cause</strong></span> so you can finally reclaim a trimmer waistline, steady mood, and renewed confidence.</p>"
      }
    },
